"Backup history stores account-scoped PhotoKit identifiers. It is much smaller than the media and prevents every scan from uploading the same photos again." = "备份历史存储的是账户范围内的 PhotoKit 标识符。它远小于媒体文件本身，并可防止每次扫描重复上传相同的照片。";

